  "notes": "Foster's verse (8 bars) + chorus (8 bars) from Paul Hardy's session ABC (K:G, with chord symbols) transposed G->C, cross-checked with the Rickheit ABC. Real pickup is two eighths C-D (1 beat); dotted-quarter + eighth figures restored (old version had no pickup and an all-quarter squashed rhythm). Verse ends on C dotted half, then a 1-beat C pickup into the chorus (as in the source). Chords bar by bar: C C C G7 | C C C-G7 C | F F C G7 | C C C-G7 C. LH: root half note then 3rd+5th dyad (G7 as B2+F3), final open C3+G3."
